WEBVTT

00:01:28.126 --> 00:01:32.338
Your mentor designed the cannon to use
a certain number of energy cells,

00:01:32.338 --> 00:01:35.466
but when the shipment arrived,
it was 3 short.

00:01:35.508 --> 00:01:40.012
So he made all of those conditions
work with this reduced number,

00:01:40.012 --> 00:01:41.806
and it fired perfectly.

00:01:42.265 --> 00:01:44.183
That’s the amount you’ll need.

00:01:44.392 --> 00:01:49.021
Too many, or too few, 
and you and the trapezist are doomed.

00:01:49.897 --> 00:01:53.442
How many energy cells should you use, 
and where?

00:01:53.693 --> 00:01:56.237
Pause here to figure it out yourself.
Answer in 3

00:01:56.237 --> 00:01:58.364
Answer in 2

00:01:58.364 --> 00:02:00.950
Answer in 1